  "brief": {
    "zh": "举着两面庆典旗跑到东北观礼台。西看台和东看台各放了一只旗箱。纸花筒只在标明的回合喷一次，覆盖本格和上下左右相邻的格子。一、二、三号纸花筒分别在第 10、34、51 回合喷发。限 66 回合。",
    "en": "Bring both festival banners to the northeast reviewing stand. The west and east grandstands each hold a banner chest. Each confetti popper fires only on its marked turn, covering its square and the squares immediately above, below, left and right. Poppers 1, 2 and 3 fire on turns 10, 34 and 51, respectively. Finish within 66 turns."
  },
